meta {
  name: Get Presigned URL - Success
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/storage/presigned-url
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "fileName": "my-avatar.png",
    "contentType": "image/png",
    "folder": "avatars"
  }
}

docs {
  ### Get Presigned R2 Upload URL
  Generates a presigned URL using Cloudflare R2 to upload files from the client.
  
  #### Headers
  - `Authorization: Bearer <authToken>` (Usually inherited or set in environmental config)
  
  #### Request Body
  - `fileName` (string, required): The original name of the file to upload.
  - `contentType` (string, required): The MIME type of the file (e.g. `image/png`, `image/jpeg`).
  - `folder` (string, optional): Folder to organize the upload (e.g. `avatars`, `gigs`). Defaults to `general`.
  
  #### Response (201 Created)
  Returns the generated presigned upload URL and the final public CDN URL.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "uploadUrl": "https://<accountId>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com/gighub/<userId>/avatars/1723456789-abcd-my-avatar.png?X-Amz-...",
      "key": "<userId>/avatars/1723456789-abcd-my-avatar.png",
      "cdnUrl": "https://cdn.gighub.ahsanull.com/<userId>/avatars/1723456789-abcd-my-avatar.png"
    },
    "message": "Pre-signed upload URL generated successfully"
  }
  ```
}
